guarded formula characterizing all counter-examples:
"∃ u n a r v d w #i #m #e.
  (Issued( u, n, a, r, v, d ) @ #i) ∧
  (Mutated( r, v, w ) @ #m) ∧
  (Executed( u, n, a, r, v, d ) @ #e)
 ∧
  (#i < #m) ∧ (#m < #e)"
*/
